    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structllvm_1_1_folding_set_trait" kindref="compound">FoldingSetTrait</ref> - This trait class is used to define behavior of how to &quot;profile&quot; (in the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_folding_set" kindref="compound">FoldingSet</ref> parlance) an object of a given type. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The default behavior is to invoke a &apos;Profile&apos; method on an object, but through template specialization the behavior can be tailored for specific types. Combined with the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_folding_set_node_wrapper" kindref="compound">FoldingSetNodeWrapper</ref> class, one can add objects to FoldingSets that were not originally designed to have that behavior. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
